{
	"name": "Bi-Way: form to welcome message",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Form to welcome message\nAn n8n form collects the contact details, creates the contact in Bi-Way (or updates it if the phone number is already known) and sends a welcome message by RCS, or by SMS on phones without RCS.\n\n### Setup\n1. **Bi-Way API** credential. The welcome message goes by RCS: An RCS agent launched by the French operators (check it with the Bi-Way node: RCS Agent › Get Status). Without one, set the channel of the Bi-Way nodes to your SMS channel: the buttons are then left out.\n2. Optional: pick a contact group in **Save the contact** › Options; without it, Bi-Way uses your default group.\n3. Add a consent field to the form if your privacy policy asks for one. Publish the workflow and share the form URL.",
				"height": 300,
				"width": 500
			},
			"id": "8197beca-048b-4635-a75d-a3b2bed54e07",
			"name": "Sticky Note setup",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-80,
				-400
			]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"formTitle": "Stay in touch",
				"formDescription": "Leave your details to receive our news.",
				"formFields": {
					"values": [
						{
							"fieldLabel": "First name",
							"requiredField": true
						},
						{
							"fieldLabel": "Last name"
						},
						{
							"fieldLabel": "Phone",
							"placeholder": "+33612345678",
							"requiredField": true
						},
						{
							"fieldLabel": "Email",
							"fieldType": "email"
						}
					]
				},
				"options": {}
			},
			"id": "99d7a28b-cb92-4da3-aea0-409ecd68fb3c",
			"name": "Sign-up form",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
			"typeVersion": 2.2,
			"position": [
				0,
				0
